msgstr "为所有用户设置「我的书库」"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"Set up My Library for every non-anonymous account? Each account starts with "
"every book it can currently see—not only books it has shelved, read, or "
"downloaded. Users can curate from there by removing books. Accounts already "
"set up are never reseeded."
msgstr "为所有非匿名账户设置“我的书库”吗？每个账户的初始书库将包含其目前可见的全部书籍，而不仅是已加入书架、已阅读或已下载的书籍。用户之后可以移除书籍来整理个人书库。已完成设置的账户不会重新填充。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"Set up My Library for every non-anonymous user? Each account switches to its "
"own selection after it is filled with everything that account can currently "
"see. Anonymous accounts such as Guest are left unchanged; use their per-user "
"controls to set up a curated public library. Accounts set up before are "
"never reseeded."
msgstr "为所有非匿名用户设置“我的书库”吗？每个账户将先填入其目前可见的全部书籍，再切换为个人选书列表。访客等匿名账户保持不变；可通过各用户的设置为其配置精选公共书库。已完成设置的账户不会重新填充。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Set up {accounts} accounts with {books} books. {errors} errors."
msgstr "已设置 {accounts} 个账户，共 {books} 本书。{errors} 个错误。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Left anonymous accounts unchanged: {accounts}. Use their per-user controls "
"to set up a curated public library."
msgstr "以下匿名账户保持不变：{accounts}。可通过各用户的设置为其配置精选公共书库。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"Show the whole library again? Your selection is kept exactly as you left it "
"— switch back any time and it is still there. At its next update, your e-"
"reader syncs the whole library."
msgstr "重新显示整个书库吗？您的选书列表将完整保留，随时切换回来仍可使用。电子阅读器将在下次更新时同步整个书库。"

