msgstr "缺少书籍获取密钥。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The acquisition tables are not ready."
msgstr "书籍获取数据表尚未就绪。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"The acquisition tables are not ready. Restart the server, then reload this "
"page."
msgstr "书籍获取数据表尚未就绪。请重启服务器，然后重新加载此页面。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"The approval queue could not be loaded, so requests may be waiting unseen."
msgstr "无法加载审批队列，可能有等待处理但未显示的请求。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"The authors, tags, publishers, and languages you enter will be removed from "
"each selected book. Books without them are left unchanged."
msgstr "您输入的作者、标签、出版社和语言将从每本选中的书籍中移除。不包含这些值的书籍保持不变。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The background scheduler is not running."
msgstr "后台调度器未运行。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The book is still opening. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "书籍仍在打开中。请稍后重试。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py cps/templates/book_edit.html
#: cps/templates/modal_dialogs.html
msgid ""
"The book record, metadata, shelves, and reading state stay available. If "
"this is the last format, you can add a replacement later."
msgstr "书籍记录、元数据、书架和阅读状态仍会保留。如果这是最后一种格式，您可以稍后添加替代文件。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The catalog could not be changed."
msgstr "无法更改目录。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The catalog could not be read"
msgstr "无法读取目录"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The catalogs could not be loaded."
msgstr "无法加载目录。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"The completed download contains multiple books. A single-book release is "
"required."
msgstr "已完成的下载包含多本书。需要仅包含一本书的发布资源。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The completed download contains no usable EPUB or PDF."
msgstr "已完成的下载不包含可用的 EPUB 或 PDF。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"The completed download is outside its mapped folder or uses an unsafe file "
"path."
msgstr "已完成的下载位于映射文件夹之外，或使用了不安全的文件路径。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"The completed-folder mapping does not cover the configured download client "
"folder."
msgstr "已完成下载文件夹的映射未覆盖所配置的下载客户端文件夹。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"The connection could not be deleted. Finish or cancel outstanding requests "
"first."
msgstr "无法删除连接。请先完成或取消尚未处理完毕的请求。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The connection did not answer with a response we can read."
msgstr "连接未返回可读取的响应。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The connection settings could not be loaded."
msgstr "无法加载连接设置。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The connection test failed."
msgstr "连接测试失败。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"The download client did not finish this download before the waiting limit. "
"Check its queue before retrying."
msgstr "下载客户端未在等待时限内完成此下载。重试前请检查其队列。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"The download client did not report a completed folder and category that "
"could be verified."
msgstr "下载客户端未上报可验证的已完成下载文件夹及分类。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"The download client for this source is unavailable. Ask an administrator to "
"check it."
msgstr "此书源的下载客户端不可用。请让管理员检查。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"The download client is unavailable or its settings changed. Make a new "
"selection after an administrator checks it."
msgstr "下载客户端不可用或其设置已改变。请在管理员检查后重新选择。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The download client reported that this download failed."
msgstr "下载客户端报告此下载失败。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py cps/templates/user_edit.html
msgid "The global library"
msgstr "全局书库"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The indexer did not return a valid NZB descriptor."
msgstr "索引器未返回有效的 NZB 描述文件。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The indexer does not advertise a supported keyword search."
msgstr "索引器未声明支持可用的关键词搜索方式。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The indexer does not advertise this book category."
msgstr "索引器未声明支持此书籍分类。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The ingest folder could not be found."
msgstr "找不到导入文件夹。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The ingest folder is not writable."
msgstr "导入文件夹不可写。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The ingest service is not running."
msgstr "导入服务未运行。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The library cover is back for you."
msgstr "已为您恢复显示书库封面。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The list of people could not be loaded."
msgstr "无法加载用户列表。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The preset change failed. Try again."
msgstr "预设更改失败。请重试。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The request could not be approved."
msgstr "无法批准请求。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The request could not be made."
msgstr "无法发起请求。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The request could not be rejected. It may have already moved on."
msgstr "无法拒绝请求。请求可能已进入后续阶段。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The request could not be retried."
msgstr "无法重试请求。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The request could not be stopped."
msgstr "无法停止请求。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py cps/templates/book_edit.html
msgid "The scan reached its limit. More ISBNs may be present in the file."
msgstr "扫描已达到上限。文件中可能还有更多 ISBN。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The server draws this cover; nothing is saved until you apply it."
msgstr "此封面由服务器绘制；应用之前不会保存。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"The server-wide option is also off, so nothing can sync yet. An "
"administrator can enable it in the classic server settings."
msgstr "服务器全局选项也已关闭，因此暂时无法同步。管理员可以在经典服务器设置中启用。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The setting could not be changed."
msgstr "无法更改设置。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py cps/templates/index.html
msgid ""
"The shared library holds every book once — My Library is your own selection. "
"Nothing is gone: every book, new arrivals included, is under Global Library "
"in the menu."
msgstr "共享书库中每本书只存储一次，“我的书库”是您的个人选书列表。书籍并未丢失，包括新书在内的所有书籍，都可以在菜单中的“全局书库”找到。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py cps/templates/index.html
msgid ""
"The shared library holds every book once — My Library is your own selection. "
"Nothing is gone: your administrator manages what enters it."
msgstr "共享书库中每本书只存储一次，“我的书库”是您的个人选书列表。书籍并未丢失，管理员负责管理加入其中的书籍。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The source asked us to wait."
msgstr "书源要求稍后再试。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The source did not answer with a catalog we can read."
msgstr "书源未返回可读取的目录。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"The source or download client rejected its credentials. Ask an administrator "
"to check the credential."
msgstr "书源或下载客户端拒绝了所用凭据。请让管理员检查凭据。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"The source redirected to a network address that this connection does not "
"allow."
msgstr "书源重定向到了此连接不允许的网络地址。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"The submission could not be confirmed. Check the download client queue and "
"history before trying again; CWNG will not blindly send a duplicate."
msgstr "无法确认是否提交成功。重试前请检查下载客户端的队列和历史记录；CWNG 不会在未确认的情况下重复提交。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"The torrent descriptor is unsupported or contains unsafe paths or links."
msgstr "不支持此种子描述文件，或其中包含不安全的路径或链接。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "The transfer did not complete."
msgstr "传输未完成。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "There are no other accounts on this server yet."
msgstr "此服务器上还没有其他账户。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "These results could not be refreshed and may be out of date."
msgstr "无法刷新这些结果，显示内容可能已过期。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"These settings could not be loaded, so nothing on this page can be trusted "
"yet."
msgstr "无法加载这些设置，目前无法确认此页面上内容的准确性。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"These settings could not be refreshed, so what is shown may be out of date."
msgstr "无法刷新这些设置，显示内容可能已过期。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "This account cannot use book sources, or the feature is switched off."
msgstr "此账户无法使用书源，或该功能已关闭。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "This account is no longer an administrator."
msgstr "此账户已不再是管理员。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "This book was already imported."
msgstr "此书已导入。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"This catalog could not be searched. Results from other catalogs are still "
"available."
msgstr "无法搜索此目录，其他目录的结果仍可查看。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "This catalog does not offer search."
msgstr "此目录不提供搜索功能。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "This catalog page is empty."
msgstr "此目录页面为空。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "This category does not exist in the download client."
msgstr "下载客户端中不存在此分类。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"This changes only your view of this book and copies delivered to your e-"
"readers. The shared book cover and everyone else’s view stay unchanged."
msgstr "这只会更改您看到的封面及发送到您电子阅读器的副本。共享书籍封面和其他人看到的封面保持不变。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"This changes the cover stored with the book. Everyone who can access the "
"book sees it."
msgstr "这会更改与书籍一同存储的封面。所有有权访问此书的人都能看到。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "This code has already been approved or declined."
msgstr "此代码已获批准或已被拒绝。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "This connection is on my home or local network"
msgstr "此连接位于我的家庭网络或局域网中"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"This database carries permissions from the old experimental Store. They need "
"review before book sources can be switched on."
msgstr "此数据库保留了旧版实验性商店的权限。开启书源之前，需要先检查这些权限。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "This device has not reported its inventory yet."
msgstr "此设备尚未上报书籍清单。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "This device will no longer sync."
msgstr "此设备将不再同步。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"This download client API version is not supported. Check the documented "
"supported versions."
msgstr "不支持此下载客户端 API 版本。请查阅文档中的受支持版本。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "This e-reader is unavailable or belongs to another account."
msgstr "此电子阅读器不可用或属于其他账户。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "This feature is currently disabled at server level."
msgstr "此功能目前在服务器层级已禁用。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "This format opens in the full-screen reader."
msgstr "此格式将在全屏幕阅读器中打开。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "This highlight has no saved position"
msgstr "此高亮没有已保存的位置"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"This is a torrent release. Choose qBittorrent or Transmission for this "
"indexer. Usenet clients accept NZB releases."
msgstr "这是种子资源。请为此索引器选择 qBittorrent 或 Transmission。Usenet 客户端接受 NZB 资源。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"This is this computer's own address, which the e-reader cannot reach. Choose "
"Change and enter the address the e-reader can use, such as "
"http://192.168.1.20:8083."
msgstr "这是此计算机自身的地址，电子阅读器无法访问。请选择“更改”，输入阅读器可访问的地址，例如 http://192.168.1.20:8083。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"This job is no longer in the download client queue or history. It will not "
"be submitted again automatically."
msgstr "下载客户端的队列或历史记录中已没有此任务，不会自动重新提交。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "This magic link can’t be checked. Generate a new one to try again."
msgstr "无法验证此免密链接。请产生新的链接再试一次。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "This magic link expired. Generate a new one to try again."
msgstr "此免密链接已过期。请产生新的链接再试一次。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "This node has fewer pages than the one you were reading."
msgstr "此节点的页数少于您之前阅读的节点。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "This page could not be refreshed, so what is shown may be out of date."
msgstr "无法刷新此页面，显示内容可能已过期。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "This page doesn't exist here."
msgstr "此页面不存在。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "This page is not available to this account."
msgstr "此账户无法访问此页面。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"This page ran into an error and could not be displayed. Your library is fine "
"— reloading usually fixes it."
msgstr "此页面遇到错误，无法显示。您的书库没有问题，重新加载通常即可解决。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "This release’s download address is not trusted by this connection."
msgstr "此连接不信任该资源的下载地址。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"This request came from a different network than the one you are using. If "
"you did not just ask for a code on your own e-reader, choose Deny."
msgstr "此请求来自与您当前使用的网络不同的网络。如果您刚才没有在自己的电子阅读器上请求代码，请选择“拒绝”。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "This request needs an administrator to approve it again."
msgstr "此请求需要管理员重新批准。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "This shelf is empty. Add books from any book's page."
msgstr "此书架是空的。请从任何书籍的页面加入书籍。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"This torrent already exists outside this request. CWNG will not adopt or "
"change an unrelated client job."
msgstr "此种子已存在于本请求之外的任务中。CWNG 不会接管或更改无关的客户端任务。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid ""
"This torrent uses a tracker outside the origins allowed by the administrator."
msgstr "此种子使用了不在管理员允许范围内的 Tracker 源。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "Title A–Z"
msgstr "标题 A–Z"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "Title Z–A"
msgstr "标题 Z–A"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "Title text"
msgstr "标题文本"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "Title, author, or ISBN"
msgstr "书名，作者，或 ISBN"

#: cps/spa_strings.py cps/templates/cwa_user_activity.html
#: cps/templates/search_form.html
msgid "To:"
msgstr "到："

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "Toggle shelf list"
msgstr "展开或收起书架列表"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "Toggle smart shelf list"
msgstr "展开或收起智能书架列表"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "Token"
msgstr "令牌"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "Token URL"
msgstr "令牌网址"

#: cps/spa_strings.py
msgid "Too many attempts. Wait a minute and try again."
msgstr "尝试次数过多。请等待一分钟后重试。"

#: cps/spa_strings.py cps/templates/_book_list_export.html
