#: cps/templates/cwng_feedback_popup.html
msgid ""
"Optional, and completely anonymous. It helps us make the new interface "
"better."
msgstr "完全自愿且匿名，帮助我们改进新界面。"

#: cps/templates/cwng_feedback_popup.html
